\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. WE love the place, O God,
\par Wherein Thine honour dwells;
\par The joy of Thine abode
\par All earthly joy excels.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. It is the house of prayer,
\par Wherein Thy servants meet;
\par And Thou, O Lord, art there,
\par Thy chosen flock to greet.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. We love the word of life,
\par The word that tells of peace,
\par Of comfort in the strife,
\par And joys that never cease.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. We love to sing below
\par Of mercies freely given;
\par But O we long to know
\par The triumph song of heaven!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Lord Jesus, give us grace
\par On earth to love Thee more,
\par In heaven to see Thy face,
\par And with Thy saints adore.
\par                          Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

